sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant Entry as Telegram / CLI
    participant Hub as Agent Hub
    participant Reg as Specialist contracts
    participant Runs as Task run store
    participant FactoryTool as LangChain tool: agent-factory
    participant Factory as Factory Brain

    You->>Entry: agent design / package lifecycle request
    Entry->>Hub: forward message
    Hub->>Reg: read advertised task kinds
    Reg-->>Hub: agent_package_lifecycle is advertised by agent-factory
    Hub->>Hub: LLM classifies task_kind = agent_package_lifecycle
    Hub->>Hub: deterministic eligibility leaves agent-factory
    Hub->>Runs: transition routed -> dispatched -> in_progress
    Hub->>FactoryTool: invoke eligible specialist tool
    FactoryTool->>Factory: invoke design request on resumable Factory thread

    Factory-->>FactoryTool: interrupted + approval_token
    FactoryTool-->>Hub: approval_required result
    Hub->>Runs: transition waiting_approval
    Hub-->>Entry: approval-required response
    Entry-->>You: design summary + approval request

    You->>Entry: approve / reject
    Entry->>Hub: resume paused run with decision
    Hub->>Runs: transition routed
    Hub->>FactoryTool: resume saved Factory thread
    FactoryTool->>Factory: resume decision

    Factory-->>FactoryTool: structured result
    FactoryTool-->>Hub: specialist result
    Hub->>Runs: finalize succeeded / paused / failed
    Hub-->>Entry: operator-facing response
    Entry-->>You: result
